---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import en from '../i18n/en.json';

const lang = 'en';
const dict = en;
---

<Layout
  lang={lang}
  title="Terms of Use | DJ Fruits and Dry Fruits Exports"
  description="Terms governing procurement estimates, weighing protocols, and mandi market indicators."
  canonicalPath="/terms"
>
  <div class="section-opaque legal-page">
    <div class="container legal-container">
      <h1 class="legal-title">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="legal-date">Last updated: 11 October 2026</p>

      <div class="legal-content">
        <h2>1. Indicative Mandi Rates</h2>
        <p>
          Mandi wholesale price figures displayed on this website are sourced from government Agmarknet feeds and historical APMC records. They represent indicative market references, not guaranteed purchase offers. Final procurement rates are confirmed only following physical inspection and brix/moisture assessment.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Weighing Slip Estimates</h2>
        <p>
          Calculations generated by the digital weighing slip widget are automated estimates based on current modal benchmarks. The final purchase memo is issued upon certified electronic platform scale weighing at our Manerajuri packhouse or authorized farm collection vehicle.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Payment & Settlement</h2>
        <p>
          Direct payments are made electronically via NEFT / RTGS to verified grower bank accounts following grading acceptance.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 4.5rem 0 6rem;
  }
  .legal-container {
    max-width: 780px;
  }
  .legal-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--canopy);
  }
  .legal-date {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: var(--canopy);
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .legal-content p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
</style>
